# Line-ending policy — normalize all text files to LF in the repository.
#
# `text=auto` lets Git detect text vs binary; `eol=lf` forces LF in the working
# tree and the index for text files, so commits never introduce CRLF noise
# (the .prettierrc requires `endOfLine: "lf"`). This applies going forward — no
# existing files are reformatted by adding this file.
* text=auto eol=lf
graphify-out/graph.json merge=graphify
